      "limitations": "Reconstruct only the inspected RoW zeolite3.9 treatment and inert-waste3.12 final-disposal market from complete native generic inert-landfill operation and facility components. Source leachate is explicitly not inventoried as considered negligible: retain that source-data gap, not a conclusion that physical leachate is zero. Do not import the old oil-catalyst-carrier or composition-specific inert-disposal emissions. Retain 1 kg operation and 1.48e-9 facility units per as-received kg, preserving their original uncertainty. The single-provider component markets add no freight or losses; source/native facilities document the same450000m3 capacity. No moisture, dry-mass, density, capacity, lifetime or allocation multiplier is inferred, including for5%-water zeolite and0.5%-water generic inert waste. The Swiss native complete generic inventories are geographic proxies for source RoW services; retain native energy supply, land-use definitions, additional waste heat, infrastructure, material/freight, allocation and vintage differences with unquantified score effects. Native use/aftercare-duration equality is not established. The3.12 market retains all three original road-freight quantities separately, with their original uncertainty, through the previously reviewed complete RER heavy-diesel fleet per tkm. Its exact ZA/BR/RoW source freight inventories match the existing regional-freight witnesses; country, class, fuel, load, duty, age and emissions mixtures are not reconstructed by this geographic fleet proxy. Add no separate vehicle, road or landfill logistics. Retain the exact nonphysical Non-hazardous waste disposed indicator where supported; if unavailable, omit only that indicator with an explicit warning and omission audit under the standing policy. No physical release, recovery credit, alternate disposal fate, empty treatment or inverse route is introduced. Negative source waste references and positive helper services require factor-1; preserve signed caller quantities, uncertainty, formulas, ownership, separate emissions and collection. Only the two enumerated exact cut-off profiles qualify. Component-rule hashes are drift witnesses, not global approval of their other profiles or old endpoints."
